                                "sense_id": "dd78233f-0206-37db-a35b-1284afbe1e07",
                                "text": "De aftrek van zakelijke kosten kan de belastbare winst van een bedrijf verlagen.",
                                "translation": "The deduction of business expenses can reduce the taxable profit of a company.",
                                "english": "The deduction of business expenses can reduce the taxable profit of a company."
                            },
